AWS Production Incident: CloudWatch Was Silent 🔕.

Everything was running fine… until users complained 😐
No alarms ❌
No alerts ❌
No emails ❌

The issue 🔍 :
CloudWatch alarms were created, but SNS was never confirmed 📭.

 🔹 Metrics existed 📊
 🔹 Alarm state changed 🔄
 🔹 But notifications never reached the team 🚫

✅ Fix:

Confirmed SNS email subscriptions ✔️
Added a backup Slack webhook 💬
Tested alarms using manual threshold breach 🧪

📌 Lesson:

 An alert that isn’t tested is as dangerous as no alert ⚠️
Always trigger and verify your CloudWatch alarms in production 🔔
